-   raw-PNG, launcher, undo, and redo routes. No pre-confirmation source pixel
-   may reappear.
+   raw-PNG, launcher, undo, and redo routes. No raster pixel from the confirmed
+   target may reappear through backing caches or standard effect recomputation.
+   Include a visual blur/pixelate crossing the secure boundary and a Smart
+   Eraser sampled directly inside it but painted outside it.
 8. Check multi-monitor negative origins and mixed/fractional scale factors.
 9. Repeat the core selection and export checks in an X11 session.
